# Claude Code integration

Shared project facts and RPI policy live in AGENTS.md. Read that import completely.
Use namespaced native skills: `/rpi-research`, `/rpi-plan`, `/rpi-implement`,
`/rpi-validate`; plugin installations use `/cc-rpi:rpi-plan` and corresponding IDs.
Native `/plan` is a mode, not the RPI artifact workflow. Claude retains native
`/simplify`. Rule bodies with path mappings use native `.claude/rules/` loading.

Model and effort inherit the deliberate session choice unless an explicitly
selected supported profile overrides them. Invocation visibility is not permission
or a sandbox. Native hook registration, trust and observed execution are separate.
